ct":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,30,75,80,81,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"1850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1027605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1044","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,30,75,80,81,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"1850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1027605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,30,75,80,81,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"1850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1027605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1044","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,30,75,80,81,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1027605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[63,30,75,80,81,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1027605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国官臣，永昌郡功曹。忠义果敢，深明大义。孟获等人联手反叛时，与永昌太守王伉共同守卫永昌，抵御孟获一行人的进攻。诸葛亮前来平定南蛮后献上《平蛮指掌图》，被诸葛亮任向导官。平定南蛮后，奉命与王伉守卫永昌四郡。后在镇压叛乱的途中，被少数民族部族所害。其子吕祥继承父志，世守永昌。","tc":"蜀國官臣，永昌郡功曹。忠義果敢，深明大義。孟獲等人聯手反叛時，與永昌太守王伉共同守衛永昌，抵御孟獲一行人的進攻。諸葛亮前來平定南蠻后獻上《平蠻指掌圖》，被諸葛亮任向導官。平定南蠻后，奉命與王伉守衛永昌四郡。后在鎮壓叛亂的途中，被少數民族部族所害。其子呂祥繼承父志，世守永昌。","en":"An official of Shu, serving as Minister of Election of Yongchang Commandery. Loyal, brave, and deeply principled. When Meng Huo and others launched a joint rebellion, he defended Yongchang alongside Governor Wang Kang, resisting the attacks of Meng Huo and his allies. When Zhuge Liang arrived to pacify the Nanman, he presented the ‘Map of Nanzhong’ and was appointed as a guide officer. After the pacification of the Nanman, he was tasked alongside Wang Kang with defending the four commanderies of Yongchang. Later, on the way to suppress a rebellion, he was killed by a local tribe. His son Lu Xiang inherited his father's ambitions, guarding Yongchang for generations.","jp":"蜀の臣。永昌郡の功曹。忠義にして果敢、大義を深く弁えていた。孟獲らが結託して反乱を起こした際、永昌太守の王伉とともに永昌を死守し、孟獲らの進攻を防ぎ止めた。諸葛亮が南蛮平定に赴くと『平蛮指掌図』を献上し、諸葛亮から嚮導官に任じられた。南蛮平定後は命を受け、王伉とともに永昌四郡を守った。後に反乱鎮圧の途上、異民族の部族に害された。子の呂祥が父の志を継ぎ、代々永昌を守った。","kr":"촉나라의 신하이자 영창군 공조였다. 충의롭고 과감하며 대의에 밝았다. 맹획 등이 결탁하여 반란을 일으켰을 때 영창태수 왕항과 함께 영창을 수호하며 맹획 일당의 공격을 막아냈다. 제갈량이 남만을 평정하러 오자 《평만지장도》를 바쳤고, 향도관으로 발탁되었다. 남만을 평정한 뒤에는 명을 받아 왕항과 함께 영창 4군을 지켰다. 훗날 반란을 진압하던 도중 소수민족 부족에게 목숨을 잃었다. 아들 여상이 아버지의 뜻을 이어 대대로 영창을 지켰다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10421","remark":"","surname":"吕","surnameTc":"呂","surnameEn":"Lu","surnameJp":"呂","surnameKr":"여","surnameOther":"","name":"凯","nameTc":"凱","nameEn":"Kai","nameJp":"凱","nameKr":"개","nameOther":"","word":"季平","wordTc":"季平","wordEn":"Jiping","wordJp":"季平","wordKr":"계평","wordOther":"","icon":"吕凯","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"213","city":"CS1044","gender":"0","rule":"63","force":"30","wise":"75","politics":"80","charm":"81","will":"89","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"7/7/7/7/7/67/16/7","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSk